# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Multi-task model: regenerable intermediates
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# ESM-2 embeddings, 366 MB. The proteome file alone is 125 MB, which EXCEEDS
# GitHub's 100 MB hard per-file limit and would cause the push to be rejected.
# Regenerate: 23_extract_esm_embeddings.py
multitask_stress_model/data/embeddings/

# Derived FASTA files -- regenerate: 20_build_multilabel_dataset.py (28 MB)
# and 21_run_cdhit_global.sh (13 MB, ~45 s). The label and split TSVs that
# actually define the dataset ARE tracked.
multitask_stress_model/data/labels/*.fasta
multitask_stress_model/data/nr/*.fasta
multitask_stress_model/data/nr/*.clstr

